WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.190
Dear sister!

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.400
When I think that I may never
be able to see you again, I...

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.320
Now, wipe away your tears...

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.320
"Goodbye" is not a word for partings.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.320
It's just a bit of spice
for the happiness of when we meet again.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.530
Sister...

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.280
Sister! Dear Sister!

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.730
What kind of friends will I make
at my next school, I wonder?

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.650
I'm looking forward to it!

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.440
Today I'll introduce a transfer student.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:45.980
This is Rina Saijo-san, who transferred here
from Shirogane Academy.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:50.230
I'm Rina Saijo. It's nice to meet you all.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.650
Isn't Shirogane Academy
that super rich-girl school?

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.570
She looks really noble, huh?

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.780
I am extremely grateful
that I can join this class so suddenly,

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.150
but I'd be happy if we become friends
regardless of if you are male or female.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.400
Wow, she seems like a normal person.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.110
By the way, my hobby...

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.440
...is to romp about with hairy males!

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.400
That wasn't normal at all!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.070
'Hairy'? She said 'hairy'?! Hairy?!

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:53.030
Excuse me...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.440
Um... um...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.860
Sorry!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.730
Oh dear...

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.690
Nice to meet you.
I'm the class representative Akiho Kosaka.

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.530
Nice to meet you! Um...

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:09.690
Does no one here like romping about with dogs?

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.230
With... dogs?

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.650
Oh, the 'hairy' thing from before...

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.980
Yes! My beloved dogs are members of the family!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.110
They're very active boys!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.690
That doesn't mean you have to talk about them
as if they were human...

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:23.730
Certainly...

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:29.150
So then, "My hobby is to get licked all over my body"
would have been more appropriate.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:31.940
I see! I'll explain it like that, then!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.400
That went unnecessarily from bad to worse...

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:38.230
What? You went to a girls' school the entire time
before you transferred here?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.280
Yes! Men of my generation are a new thing!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:44.980
That's why when it comes to
how to deepen a friendship...

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:48.070
Between girls it's mostly like this...

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:50.780
There are two delicious-looking fruits here.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.070
And you can harvest them year-round!

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.030
Well, they are humans,
so the same type of thing is okay, right?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.730
Then here you go!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.070
That is not okay!

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.360
Do you not want to touch me?

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.780
That really isn't the prob-

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.150
Shinozaki-san?

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.400
What do I do?!

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.530
You two are together, aren't you?

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:16.190
Yeah, actually... we are.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.650
What is it about Shinozaki-kun that captivates you?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.530
Well, it's...

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:24.980
We have nothing in common,

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:30.230
so even while he's exploring the unknown,
he keeps his courage, his tolerance...

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:35.320
his compassion and heartbreak,
his resolve and his tears all to himself!

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.650
That's a bit complicated...

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:40.570
How about if you were to convey
all of that in one word?

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.360
Let me see... Umm. That's tough.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.530
It won't all fit into one word.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.530
A male/female couple, huh?

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.980
That's very rare.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.650
Uh, no, I think it's common...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.110
Up until now, I've only seen relations between girls.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.320
What?! There's no way it was the same for you!

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:08.610
No, I knew that through gossip around me.
I didn't have a lover.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.190
I-I see...

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.690
Yes, that's why...

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.190
...I go to this degree of flirting with my classmates.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.570
Isn't there something wrong about this?! Huh?!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:23.980
And that's why it's my first time
to deepen a friendship with a gentleman.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.320
There are still so many more things I must study!

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.940
Well then, how about asking an instructor?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.480
Good idea!

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:36.150
It seems I'll be able to gather things on
many gentlemen and ask everything all at once!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.610
Ma'am!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.400
Please teach Rina-san everything about men!

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:42.900
Huh?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.190
There are so many things wrong here!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.690
Like the way you're asking
and the person being asked!

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:49.650
Shinozaki-kun alone can't satisfy me...

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.150
She said you can't satisfy her.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.230
This is an enormous misunderstanding.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.190
Ah, satisfaction...!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:02.110
Kosaka-san, are you an A, B, or C?

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:02.860
Huh?!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.030
I'm a C!

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.940
I-is that so?

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.860
I-I'm sorry...

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:14.190
I'm more than C...
and they've gotten bigger recently...

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:18.030
Kosaka-san, she's just talking about the lunch menu!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.980
More than C?!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.690
I want to try a bite of that!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.980
Stop this convo now!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.280
To continue our talk about deepening a friendship...

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:37.070
What kind of subject can men and women
mutually converse about?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:41.150
Hmm, let's see... something like musical interests?

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.780
In that case, I can possibly speak a bit about it!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.480
Do you listen to a good amount of genres?

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.440
I do!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.150
Classical...

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:50.650
J-Pop...

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.730
and also, Adult Alternative!

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.780
Let's go ahead and cut that last one off.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.530
So this is the one where you wreck the blocks, huh?

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:00.980
Is this your first time playing?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.530
My mother doesn't allow me to play games...

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.820
But I'm aware of a lot of them
just from looking up the names.

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.440
Is there any other one you want to try?
I'll get the app for you.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.860
Is that really okay?!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:16.070
I want something to wreck me!

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:17.900
That isn't a game.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.940
You'll wreck that up too, huh...

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.530
Shinozaki-kun, let's go to the bathroom together!

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.860
Why?! And it's not like we can!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:31.110
I heard that that's the best way
to deepen friendships with gentlemen.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.440
Men and women cannot go together!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.190
Aww, that's too bad...

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.530
Saijo-san...

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.280
Shinozaki-san, please, I beg you to reconsider!

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.530
I'll come along as well for support!

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:42.820
That's even worse!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.940
Haru, yoo-hoo!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.480
What's this? There's a pretty girl here!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.070
She's the transfer student, Rina Saijo-san.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.530
A pleasure to meet you!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:56.820
Hello! I'm Haru's mistress, Shizuku Ariyama.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.440
We're about as lovey-dovey
as he is with his girlfriend!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:00.570
Hey, stop...

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.940
Wow... you're that close with a gentleman...!

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:06.030
I want to become a mistress too!

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.230
Huh, for real?! Wh-what do I do...

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:10.110
That would be my line...

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:15.280
I see! So you're in the middle of studying men?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.780
Yes, I want to deepen our friendship...

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.860
To that end, it'll be a cinch
if you tempt him with your chest.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:22.070
This is a new discovery!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.650
Don't indoctrinate her with strange ideas!

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:27.320
Please, by all means,
let me see an example for reference!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.190
W-wait a second...

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.860
There... Flop, flop...

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.400
I can do it, I can do it...

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.900
Sis, stop it already!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:43.110
Did I do something bad? Did I do something bad?

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:44.610
Saijo-san, calm dow-

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:48.860
This is becoming like an intensely dreadful scene!

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.480
Everyone, you misunderstand!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.190
Shinozaki-san doesn't have
a single inkling of adultery in him!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.610
Kosaka-san! You've saved me!

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:55.530
That's because...

00:08:55.530 --> 00:09:00.070
he is a super loli-pervert that can only get aroused
if he's naked and wearing a nursery school hat!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:03.980
Haruka Shinozaki...

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.570
...has died.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:11.030
Thank you for today.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.820
I was nervous about many things my first day,

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.780
but thanks to you two it seems
I'll have a fun high school life!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.940
Oh, that's good.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:22.900
I've suffered a fair amount of damage, though...

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:28.360
Um... Is it alright if I think of you two as friends?

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.280
Yeah.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.440
Of course it is.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.820
And may I call you by name?

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.150
That's completely okay!

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:35.860
W-well then...

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:39.570
H..Haruka-kun, Akiho-chan...

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.650
Eeek! I'm so happy!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:45.070
I made a friend! I made a friend!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.530
Kosaka-san looks like the happiest one here.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.070
Then I hope we can continue to get along.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.360
I hope for the same.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:56.530
She's a bit strange... but Saijo-san
seems like a good person in the end.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.780
Ah, it seems my ride has arrived.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.780
Bye, see you tomorrow.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.820
Friend...

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:02.650
Right.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.530
See you tomorrow.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:08.280
Okay, now you two give me
a goodbye kiss...

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.730
Wait, what?

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.940
Th-that's... what friends...?

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:15.650
No, even if you're friends,
we don't really kiss each other on the cheek.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.480
Th-that's right!

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.360
You mean they normally kiss on the mouth, right?

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.320
That's not what I meant!

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.150
Welcome.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:25.610
Don't get so cheeky over a misunderstanding!

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.570
Huh? Icchan, are you going home now?

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:34.030
Yeah, I finally finished filing documents.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.030
Aoi, what's up with you?
You don't really have anything to do, right?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.400
Let me see...

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.150
Unpaid overtime?

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.940
What do you mean by that?

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:49.940
S-so this is how it goes, huh...

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:56.280
Saijo-san, is there something on your mind?

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.940
I can give you advice if you want.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:59.230
Haruka-kun...

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:04.780
Actually, a friend from my previous school
has ended our relationship...

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:05.360
Huh?

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:08.110
I thought we could at least
spend some time together...

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:10.610
and we were such good friends...

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.150
Yesterday, she suddenly said "Not while we're friends!"

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.320
Oh, well, maybe that doesn't mean
she's ended the relationship...

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.570
Please don't cry, Rina-san!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.530
You and I are friends forever,
and abbreviated, we're 'FFL's!

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:27.730
Akiho-chan!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:32.030
But... You might come to hate me someday.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:32.900
Inconceivable!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:35.610
If anything, I'll become your emotional support!

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:38.980
I guess I can relax for now if Kosaka-san is here.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:42.820
Thank you, Akiho-chan!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:44.440
I can't relax at all!

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:46.480
Girls are so amazing!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:51.900
Actually, last night as well,
two males licked my body all over...

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:55.940
Ah, are you talking about your male pet dogs?!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.980
In the Saijo household, dogs and humans
are considered equals, right?!

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.030
That's right.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.780
By the way, what are their names?

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.860
Butter and Margarine!

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.530
Who in the world named them that?!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:12.570
We always walk the same course at the park.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:15.320
Since it's spacious,
it's pleasant for the dogs, right?

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.610
Want to go along too next time?

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.320
O-on a walk?

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:23.570
Yeah, sounds fun.
Like we're accompanying Saijo-san.

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:29.070
U-um... If it's after I can prepare myself for it...

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.940
Oh, do you dislike dogs?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:32.730
No...

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:36.280
I have to measure the size of my neck.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.360
What do you mean?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.030
That's right!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:43.780
Since we're going to the effort,
how about we all hang out instead of going on a walk?

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.480
Like to the zoo!

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.480
Sounds good.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.150
Invite Shizuku-san too!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.360
I will go.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.230
I can't wait!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.690
Okay! We're gonna conquer it all in one day!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:12:59.530
Yes we will!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.570
Let me see, where are the Japanese macaque?

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:06.400
Monkey Mountain is
34 meters ahead on the right.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.070
You really know the zoo, huh?
Do you come here a lot?

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.360
Yes. I was taken here often
by my mother in the past.

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:17.230
She taught me all about things like
the ecology and dietary habits of animals.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.780
So your knowledge is just as extensive
as your mom's, huh?

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.730
She was especially conscientious about things
like mating habits and courtship behavior...

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.360
Really, just like hers...

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.820
Oh, excuse me, Natsuo-san.

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.030
Don't worry about it.

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:36.030
Right now, Akiho is on
a date with Shinozaki-kun, huh?

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.780
Is this that 'independence from parents' thing?

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.360
It probably is.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.530
Time passes so quickly.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:48.110
If I close my eyes like this,
memories from long ago come back to life.

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.530
Pick me up!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.440
It's true!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.730
You in the process of making babies, oh my...

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.400
Please think about memories with Akiho.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.190
I know, how about we go somewhere
for the first time in a while?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.650
R-really?! I'd love to!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.900
Then how about a date to the zoo or something?

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.820
You used to go a lot, huh?

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:08.980
I wonder if it's still open now?

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.230
I'll call and ask.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.610
It's okay!

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:15.570
They said the animals
are doing it actively today as well!

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:17.690
Ask them if they're open, okay?

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:22.150
We're searching for a name for the baby panda!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.280
Please feel free to submit one!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.230
They say they're looking for baby panda names.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.940
Normally, they do names like
"Lin-Lin" and "Shin-Shin" right?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.860
That's right, something that repeats.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:32.650
Then how about "Chin-chi-"?

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.280
That word is no good!

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:36.530
Then a more refined one, "Sir Chin-chi-"

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.230
Sorry, this one's my fault!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.190
So this is the park area.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.110
I didn't know even the zoo has this type of place.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.400
Can we take a little look at it?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.150
Huh?!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.900
P-please reconsider doing that!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:50.900
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:53.980
I don't want you to be a criminal!

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.150
Huh? Uh, no way.

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:58.610
When is this loli-centered misunderstanding
going to be cleared up?

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.480
I-it won't bite me?

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.690
It's okay. It looks like there are
a lot of friendly animals.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.440
It's true!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.690
See, like this one!

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.230
M-Miss...

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.820
Those animals are not included.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.860
Horses are so cool... I want to ride one!

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:23.820
But it looks like that can't be done here.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.070
How about a wooden horse instead?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.070
Neigh!

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.070
I'm not gonna ride that!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.940
It's different when you're a kid.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.280
Sorry, sorry.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.320
Now, an adult wooden horse is better, huh?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.230
Neeee~igh!

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.650
Move away from the 'wooden horse' thing.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.440
We can pet the doggies too, right?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.070
It's pretty big.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.900
It's bigger than I thought!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.150
I-it is...

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:51.190
Even bigger than Haru?

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.440
What?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:57.030
Akiho-chan, do you like the big ones or the small ones?

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.110
I... I can't make that decision.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:02.360
Some big ones also have huge brown eyes!

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.650
Y-you're quite experienced with this, aren't you...

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:08.320
Oh no! If I don't stop this course of conversation...

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.070
O-of course they have huge brown eyes!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.440
Like on the head!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:13.730
You're right!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:17.860
Oh my. If this one stands up,
he's possibly bigger than Haruka-kun.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:18.360
WHAT?!

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:20.650
Oh no! It's not stopping!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:24.730
N-no, but compared to long ago,
he's growing, I think.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.190
And this doggie definitely has, since he's a dog...

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:29.230
Don't look down when you're talking, look up!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:32.480
G-guys! Why don't we move on now?!

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:35.360
Oh, is there another animal you want to see?

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.070
L-let's see...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.940
Oh! I want to go see that gigantic turtle!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:44.190
Well! I wonder which is bigger:
that turtle or Haruka-kun?

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:47.150
No way, you're gonna compare
your own little turtle to that turtle?

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:49.150
It's because he's a fairly sore loser.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:49.980
You're wrong!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.530
Understood. Let's go.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.070
We'll compare the turtles!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:59.980
They'll say that today, the animal that garnered
the most attention was Haruka Shinozaki...

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.030
Hey, Sakiccho...

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:06.860
Hey, hey, Sakiccho... Sakiccho...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.280
U-um, hey, Kana-chan...

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.320
Isn't that nickname kind of strange?

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:15.190
If you can, I want you
to just call me 'Misaki' normally.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.400
Huh? Sakiccho, you don't have to be so stiff!

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.690
Th-they aren't stiff!

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:26.690
Oh... no, I didn't mean that "sakiccho" just now,
I was talking about the "Sakiccho" nickname...

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.900
Um, what?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.730
Weird ol' Sakiccho!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.110
Weir-?!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.900
M-my "sakiccho" are not weird!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.650
"My"?

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.280
Misaki Aikawa's nickname
is now decided to be "Sakiccho!"

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:47.940
Look, Natsuo-san! It's an elephant! An elephant!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.690
You've always liked elephants haven't you?

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:52.940
Yes.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.110
They're big and powerful,

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:58.650
and I love that they always shoot with such vigor.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:05.940
I'm sorry... Sarcasm doesn't seem to work well...

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.940
Please don't worry about it.

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:13.440
The baby panda is so cute.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.650
Yeah.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:19.820
Seeing that it drinks and is fawned over and such,
it's really not so different from a human.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.480
I-I'm sorry...

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.360
When you add alcohol into it, I suddenly...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:24.860
Hey, we're talking about babies, you know!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:28.570
Sakiccho, look at that!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:31.530
It says that this animal
has really strong breeding prowess!

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:34.320
Wh-why is that what you're pointing out?

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:37.190
I see. It has established a reputation
for its breeding prowess...

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.780
H-her too?!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:44.860
I see. If I really think about it,
'breeding' is a normal thing for animals...

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.730
I don't need to take some sort of
strange meaning from this...

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:51.150
I'm also curious about the mode of breeding!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.480
By the way, what's 'breeding'?

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.230
You're wrong!

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:02.320
Sakiccho, you move so fast!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.480
Mommy...

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.610
Oh my, are you lost?

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.940
There, there, don't worry.

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.820
Look there. There are so many animals.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:19.440
It seems like things will be okay
if I leave it to her for a bit.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:20.780
And that there...

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.480
is the mating behavior of monkeys.

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:25.190
Oh yeah! Monkeys mating! You can do it!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.320
Is there anyone searching for a lost child?!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.530
Ouch... Did I twist it?

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:33.650
Are you okay, Natsuo-san?

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:39.860
Sorry, I moved it a bit and this happened.
This is why I don't want to get older.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.690
Your body gets weak, and you get tired quickly.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:46.530
Well, but for that part,
you can just improve technique and-

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.780
Y-you're missing the point of this conversation!

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.650
Sorry, Fuyumi.

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.400
Don't worry about it.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.980
I feel like this type of thing
happened only yesterday, too...

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:00.900
The eagerness of that first date was good, but...

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:03.320
I dragged my feet from beginning to end...

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.230
But even so, Fuyumi was...

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:08.230
Natsuo-san.

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:13.150
Thank you so very much
for accompanying me today.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:18.400
I was very happy to be
able to go on a date with you.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:23.230
Really... I'm glad I could marry you.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.940
Wh-what is this all of a sudden?!

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.980
That was fun!

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:29.900
It was!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.360
Wanna head home soon?

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:31.940
Yes.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:35.900
Well, I have plans with Ricchan now,
so this is where we part.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:36.320
Huh?

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:37.860
S-Sis?

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.400
Um, but...

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.780
Don't worry about it. Bye now, you two!

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:51.400
W-well, wanna head home?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.400
Y-yes.

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:45.150
Sh..Shinozaki-kun, Akiho?!

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.400
H-hello!

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:47.730
J-just now, were your hands...?

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:51.860
And you two... In the streets
with your arms around each other intimately...

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:53.480
Th-that's not what it was!

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:59.440
Natsuo-san twisted his ankle,
and he asked if we could rest somewhere, so...

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:00.190
Oh dear.

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:14.110
Is this room 301? But, what? The lock won't open...

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:16.650
Try to put it further into the back of the hole.

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:17.900
Like this?

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:23.030
And then turn it even further than that...
Like that, Shinozaki-san!

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:24.320
Just a little more...

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:26.440
Oh, the door opened!

00:23:29.610 --> 00:23:31.900
Shinozaki-san... Are you going to go in?

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:37.230
Yeah, since we just opened a
door that gets stuck easily, you know?!

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:39.360
Are you talking to someone?
